ftware, such as inspection, maintenance, and repair services for its automatic entrance solutions; software as a service, including access control, platform integration, and workforce management solutions; and ongoing aftermarket services, and design and installation offerings. In addition, the company sells its products and solutions to end-users in commercial, institutional, and residential facilities, including education, healthcare, government, hospitality, retail, commercial office, and single and multi-family residential markets under the CISA, Interflex, LCN, Schlage, SimonsVoss, and Von Duprin brands. It sells its products and solutions through distribution and retail channels, such as specialty distribution, e-commerce, and wholesalers, as well as through various retail channels comprising do-it-yourself home improvement centers, online and e-commerce platforms, and small specialty showroom outlets. Allegion plc was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Dublin, Ireland.","description_en":"Allegion plc engages in the provision of security products and solutions worldwide. It is operating through two segments: Allegion Americas and Allegion International. The company offers door controls, door control system, and exit devices; doors, glass and door systems, and accessories; electronic security products and access control systems, including time, attendance, and workforce productivity; and locks, locksets, portable locks, and key systems. It also provides services and software, such as inspection, maintenance, and repair services for its automatic entrance solutions; software as a service, including access control, platform integration, and workforce management solutions; and ongoing aftermarket services, and design and installation offerings. In addition, the company sells its products and solutions to end-users in commercial, institutional, and residential facilities, including education, healthcare, government, hospitality, retail, commercial office, and single and multi-family residential markets under the CISA, Interflex, LCN, Schlage, SimonsVoss, and Von Duprin brands. It sells its products and solutions through distribution and retail channels, such as specialty distribution, e-commerce, and wholesalers, as well as through various retail channels comprising do-it-yourself home improvement centers, online and e-commerce platforms, and small specialty showroom outlets. Allegion plc was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Dublin, Ireland.","description_zh":"Allegion plc（美股代碼：ALLE）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Security & Protection Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Unit No. 233","city":"Dublin","state":"HE","zip":"D07 X324","country":"IE","phone":"353 1 6833399","full_address":"Unit No. 233, Dublin, HE D07 X324, IE","range_52w":"125-192.44","year_high":192.44,"year_low":125,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":125,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-27","name":"Eckersley Timothy P","title":"officer: President-Intl & SVP-Allegion","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6364,"price":178.62,"total_val":1.14},{"date":"2026-10-27","name":"Kemp Tracy L","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Info. & Digital Ofr","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4469,"price":88.08,"total_val":0.39},{"date":"2026-10-27","name":"Kemp Tracy L","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Info. & Digital Ofr","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":4469,"price":178.81,"total_val":0.8},{"date":"2026-10-27","name":"Kemp Tracy L","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Info. & Digital Ofr","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":4469,"price":88.08,"total_val":0.39},{"date":"2026-08-31","name":"MIZELL STEVEN","title":"director","is_buy":true,"action":"P-Purchase","shares":170,"price":158.28,"total_val":0.03},{"date":"2026-08-20","name":"Eckersley Timothy P","title":"officer: President-Intl & SVP-Allegion","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":1527,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-20","nam